{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45930","headline":"上冯使君山水障子 · 贯休","name":"上冯使君山水障子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆山归未得，画出亦堪怜。\n崩岸全隳路，荒村半有烟。\n笔句冈势转，墨抢烧痕颠。\n远浦深通海，孤峰冷倚天。\n柴棚坐逸士，露茗煮红泉。\n绣与莲峰竞，威如劒阁牵。\n石门关麈鹿，气候有神仙。\n茅屋书窗小，苔堦滴瀑圆。\n松根击石朽，桂叶蚀霜鲜。\n画出欺王墨，擎将献惠连。\n新诗宁妄说，旧隐实如然。\n愿似窗中列，时闻大雅篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45930.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45930","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}